\end{equation}
This equation represents the relationship between perceived threat and coping resources in determining an individual's level of stress. If an individual perceives a high level of threat but has few coping resources, their stress level will be high. On the other hand, if an individual perceives a low level of threat and has many coping resources, their stress level will be low.

